# firecoin_acela0.1-0

> Solidity snapshot for Fire Coin (Acela 0.1-0). Sister of fire-coin-app.

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to the contract snapshot. Source: fitzyracing1/firecoin_acela0.1-0.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the place for Solidity files.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader back to the source.

## Key ideas
- Fire Coin contract snapshot
- Acela 0.1-0
- Solidity source

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/firecoin_acela0.1-0
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to the Solidity snapshot”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants the app face → fire-coin-app
- If a reader wants this contract snapshot → stay on the source

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on a token-contract snapshot.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source.
